<title>PHILIPPINES: TABLE-Philippine T-bills secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Philippine T-bills secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Friday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>			    3-mths	   6-mths	   1-year</p>
<p>Citibank		 11.50 /11.00  12.00 /11.75    12.50 /12.00</p>
<p>Hongkong Bank	  12.10 /11.85  12.50 /12.25    12.80 /12.625</p>
<p>Metrobank		12.25 /12.00  12.75 /12.50    13.625/13.50</p>
<p>Multinational	  11.50 /11.25  11.75 /11.50    12.25 /11.90</p>
<p>Standard Chartered   12.75 /12.25  13.00 /12.50    13.50 /12.50</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone (632) 841 8937</p>
